calls, after their respective fill/no-fill and vertical-space handling.
Also report the item start after man(7)/mdoc(7) item pre-handlers perform
their native spacing, even when an empty item has no NODE_ID.  These are
unresolved buffer gaps; the embedding must follow the native field and
post-device result before publishing a zero-width display point.  No
formatter output or pager tag behavior changes.

